flowchart LR
  Photo[Original photo Evidence] --> OCR[OCR candidate Evidence]
  OCR --> Corr[Corrected Evidence]
  Corr --> Resp[Confirmed LearningResponse]
  Resp --> Diag[Diagnosis]
  Diag --> Finding
  Finding --> KI[KnowledgeIssue]
  Finding --> Dec[DecisionRecord]
  Dec --> Int[LearningIntervention]
  Int --> Verify[New LearningResponse verification]
  Verify --> State[StateRevision + References]
